+Nothing is silently defaulted. If the file is missing, a key is unknown, or a value is empty or invalid, the relay
+prints every problem to standard error and exits with status 2 without starting. Omitted optional keys use the
+defaults above.
+
 ## Tests
 
     java tools/RunTests.java
 
 The runner compiles `src/main/java` and `src/test/java` and runs every JUnit 5 test. It needs
 `lib/junit-platform-console-standalone.jar`.
